  vignettes:
  - image: {fileID: -1870357709, guid: dda96eb34db6a414da24e64d6f8f452c, type: 3}
    text: You have arrived at the labyrinth of emotions... located in a futuristic
      city, which is not in the best of states.
  - image: {fileID: 324211567, guid: dda96eb34db6a414da24e64d6f8f452c, type: 3}
    text: Here, you will have to make your way through various emotionally charged
      situations, in order to gain the necessary knowledge....
  - image: {fileID: -1018484990, guid: dda96eb34db6a414da24e64d6f8f452c, type: 3}
    text: The astral plane will be of great help to you on your way to the understanding
      of emotions, take advantage of it.
  - image: {fileID: 1045627247, guid: dda96eb34db6a414da24e64d6f8f452c, type: 3}
    text: After the arduous journey, you will reach the centre of the labyrinth,
      where you will find the necessary answers...
  nextButtonText: Next
